# The context is packages/browseros-agent. The server needs every workspace member's manifest
# and sources plus its lockfile. The standalone viewer and runtime inputs are selected below.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates
!apps/claw-server
**/node_modules
# Only Cargo's output at the root: `**/target` would also drop source modules such as
# browseros-core/src/target/.
target
# The CAPTCHA testbed beside neo-captcha's sources is no build input either.
crates/neo-sdk/neo-captcha/testbed
# Only the viewer's build inputs, Rust integration tests and shipped assets enter the context.
crates/neo-sdk/neo-slimviewer
!crates/neo-sdk/neo-slimviewer/Cargo.toml
!crates/neo-sdk/neo-slimviewer/Cargo.lock
!crates/neo-sdk/neo-slimviewer/build.rs
!crates/neo-sdk/neo-slimviewer/csrc
crates/neo-sdk/neo-slimviewer/csrc/*.Dockerfile
!crates/neo-sdk/neo-slimviewer/src
!crates/neo-sdk/neo-slimviewer/tests/**/*.rs
!crates/neo-sdk/neo-slimviewer/web/slimviewer.html
!crates/neo-sdk/neo-slimviewer/web/ui.js
# This folder's scripts and docs are not build inputs, so editing them leaves the image cached.
# The browser pin, the server's build step and the supervisor (supervisor/, its tests aside) are.
crates/neo-sdk/neo-server/docker
!crates/neo-sdk/neo-server/docker/browser.lock
!crates/neo-sdk/neo-server/docker/build-server.sh
!crates/neo-sdk/neo-server/docker/supervisor
crates/neo-sdk/neo-server/docker/supervisor/*_test.py
**/__pycache__
